{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06468","headline":"题鹤林寺 · 綦毋潜","name":"题鹤林寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"道林隐形胜，向背临层霄。\n松覆山殿[冷]，花藏谿路遥。\n珊珊宝幡挂，焰焰明灯烧。\n迟日半空谷，春风连上潮。\n少凭水木兴，暂令身心调。\n愿谢携手客，兹山禅诵饶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"綦毋潜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06468.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06468","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}